<title>RUSSIA: Russia's RTS-24 index rises to record 301.50.</title>
<headline>Russia's RTS-24 index rises to record 301.50.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Trading System's 24-share index broke through 300 on Monday for the first time, rising to a record 301.50 at 1300 GMT from 292.67 at Friday's close, an official at the NAUFOR brokers' association said.</p>
<p>Turnover so far on Monday was a high $32.59 million, he said in answer to an enquiry.</p>
<p>--Olga Popova, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
